---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import privacyImage from '../../assets/images/privacy-shield.webp';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy - How FoodCheck Protects Your Data" description="FoodCheck privacy policy. Learn how we handle your data — spoiler: we don't collect any. All tools run entirely in your browser." breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy', href: '/privacy' }]}>
<Header />
<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-6 tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-8">Last updated: July 2026</p>

  <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 mb-8">FoodCheck is committed to protecting your privacy. This policy explains how we handle information when you use our website and tools.</p>
  <Image src={privacyImage} alt="Privacy and data protection document" class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl mb-8" width={800} height={450} loading="lazy" format="webp" />

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">Data Collection</h2>
  <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">We do <strong>not</strong> collect, store, or transmit any personal data. All FoodCheck tools — including the Food Intolerance Checker, individual intolerance checkers, Food Diary, and Elimination Diet Planner — run entirely in your web browser.</p>

  <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">What Data Stays on Your Device</h3>
  <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">Your symptom checker results, food diary entries, and elimination diet plans are stored locally in your browser. We have no access to this data. Clearing your browser data will permanently remove all saved entries.</p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">Local Storage</h2>
  <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">The Food Diary tool uses your browser's <strong>localStorage</strong> to save entries on your device. This data:</p>
  <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-slate-600 space-y-2 mb-6">
    <li>Stays entirely on your device</li>
    <li>Is never sent to our servers or any third party</li>
    <li>Can be deleted at any time by clearing your browser data</li>
    <li>Cannot be accessed by other websites</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">Cookies</h2>
  <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">We do not use cookies for tracking or advertising. We do not use any analytics services (such as Google Analytics).</p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">Our site loads web fonts from Google Fonts (Google LLC). When your browser requests these fonts, Google may log your IP address. Please refer to <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Privacy Policy</a> for more information.</p>

  <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">External Services Used</h3>
  <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-slate-600 space-y-2 mb-6">
    <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> — used for typography. Google may log IP addresses during font requests.</li>
    <li><strong>Hosting/CDN</strong> — basic request logs (IP, user agent, timestamp) for security and caching.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">Hosting</h2>
  <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">This site may be hosted on a CDN or static hosting provider. These providers may log basic request information (IP address, user agent, timestamp) for security and performance purposes. We do not access or use this data.</p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">Medical Disclaimer</h2>
  <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">FoodCheck provides educational content only. We do not provide medical diagnosis, treatment, or advice. Always consult your GP, a gastroenterologist, or a registered dietitian for medical concerns.</p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.</p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">Contact</h2>
  <p class="text-slate-600">If you have any questions about this privacy policy, you can reach us at <a href="/about" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline">our About page</a>.</p>
</main>
<Footer />
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "Privacy Policy",
  "description": "FoodCheck privacy policy — we do not collect, store, or share any personal data. All tools run entirely in your browser.",
  "url": "https://foodintolerancecheck.com/privacy",
  "isPartOf": {
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "name": "FoodCheck",
    "url": "https://foodintolerancecheck.com"
  }
}
</script>
</BaseLayout>
